# Hestia plugins

A [Hestia](https://github.com/prytaneum/hestia) plugin repository: one folder per plugin under `plugins/`.

```bash
hestia plugin new <id>     # add a plugin
hestia plugin pack         # build dist/<id>-<version>.hplugin for every plugin
hestia plugin add dist/<id>-<version>.hplugin
```
